  body: "# Capital disregard purpose and actual income\n\n**Model-assisted source interpretation; unreviewed.
    No entitlement decision or executable rule.**\n\nThe captured paragraph explains that some capital
    is disregarded only for the deemed-income rule, so actual income generated by it may still be taken
    into account.\n\n## Evidence and scope\n\n[DMG 85006, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=5)
    supports this scoped proposal. The source PDF SHA-256 is `fe6fe79a4ff52271d6edf97af6b01ebd4290867b30d6288c38eb5e3a6d613c74`.\n\
    \nThe surrounding paragraphs distinguish other capital-income cases. Do not turn this scoped distinction
    into a rule that all actual income is included or all disregarded capital produces excluded income.\n\
    \nThe capture date, the publication page's update date and a date stated in the guidance have different
    meanings. Linked legislation and memos need their own provision, version and applicability review.\n\
    \nMemo references are navigation to separately captured source evidence. They do not assert incorporation,
    supersession or current legal validity.\n"
  semantic_relations:
  - target: term/capital-disregards
    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The paragraph explicitly distinguishes the purpose of a capital disregard from
      treatment of actual income, connecting the two topics without treating all disregards as
      equivalent.
    evidence:
    - page: page/85/0005
      quote: "85006 Certain types of capital (such as a property held in a discretionary trust) are disregarded
        only for\n\nthe purpose of applying the deemed income rule1, so any actual income the capital
        asset generates will\nbe taken into account.\n\n\nNote: DMG chapter 84 gives guidance on how to
        calculate an amount of deemed weekly income from\ncapital and explains when certain capital is
        disregarded for income purposes.\n\n\n                                                       \
        \                            1 SPC Regs, Sch V, Part II"
      locator: DMG 85006
  - target: term/deemed-weekly-income
